<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <title>Extension Approved</title>
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; }
        .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
        .header { background: #28a745; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; }
        .content { padding: 20px; background: #f8f9fa; }
        .approved { background: #d4edda; border: 1px solid #c3e6cb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .deadline { background: #d1ecf1; border: 1px solid #bee5eb; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 5px; }
        .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #666; font-size: 12px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>✅ Extension Approved</h1>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Deadline Extension Approved</h2>
            
            <div class="approved">
                <strong>🎉 APPROVED:</strong> Your deadline extension request has been approved!
            </div>
            
            <h3>Request Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Request ID:</strong> {{request.id}}</li>
                <li><strong>Description:</strong> {{request.description}}</li>
                <li><strong>Status:</strong> {{request.status}}</li>
            </ul>
            
            <h3>Extension Details:</h3>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Requested Days:</strong> {{extension.requestedDays}}</li>
                <li><strong>Reason:</strong> {{extension.reason}}</li>
                <li><strong>Approval Date:</strong> {{extension.respondedAt}}</li>
            </ul>
            
            <div class="deadline">
                <strong>⏰ NEW DEADLINE:</strong> {{newDeadline}}
            </div>
            
            <p><strong>What This Means:</strong></p>
            <ul>
                <li>Your extension request has been granted</li>
                <li>The deadline has been extended by {{extension.requestedDays}} days</li>
                <li>You now have until {{newDeadline}} to complete the translation</li>
                <li>The request status has been updated to "Extension Approved"</li>
            </ul>
            
            <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
            <ol>
                <li>Continue working on your translation</li>
                <li>Ensure completion by the new deadline</li>
                <li>Submit your work when finished</li>
            </ol>
            
            <p><strong>Important:</strong> Please make sure to complete the translation by the new deadline to avoid any further issues.</p>
            
            <p>Thank you for your understanding and good luck with your translation work!</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>This is an automated message from HereToTranslate</p>
            <p>Please do not reply to this email</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
